@startuml forkcast_sequence_closed
title Forkcast - weighing with the app closed (Android)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam dpi 140
autonumber

participant "Paired scale" as Scale
participant "Android CDM" as Cdm
participant "PresenceService\n(Kotlin, foreground service)" as Presence
participant "PlacementDetector\n(Kotlin, per adapter)" as Detector
participant "OS notifications" as Notif
participant "Screens +\nScaleLink (JS)" as App
actor "Phone user" as User

User -> Scale : turn on
Scale -> Cdm : advertises
Cdm -> Presence : device appeared (wakes service)
Presence -> Presence : start connectedDevice service\n(persistent notification)
Presence -> Scale : connect (Android BLE API)
Scale -> Presence : measurement packets
Presence -> Detector : grams + stable flag
Detector -> Detector : placement rule\n(min weight held, SRS 9.4)
Detector --> Presence : placement started
Presence -> Notif : post once per placement
Notif --> User : "Something is being weighed"
alt user taps the notification
  User -> App : tap (unlock if locked)
  App -> Presence : take over
  Presence -> Scale : disconnect
  App -> Scale : connect with react-native-ble-plx
  App --> User : Live weighing with the live weight,\ncontinue as in UC-05
else notification ignored
  Presence -> Presence : nothing saved (FR-42)
end
Scale -> Scale : auto-off
Cdm -> Presence : device disappeared / disconnected
Presence -> Presence : stop service, remove\nnotification (NFR-19)

legend bottom
  No JavaScript runs and nothing is written while the app is closed (FR-44, NFR-02).
  Best effort: verify CDM presence on Filliciano's phone and Android version.
  If unavailable, Settings says so and weighing works with the app open (FR-47).
endlegend
@enduml
